    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2997</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>13000000</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここがペトナジャンカ……
ずいぶん静かな街だな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então esta é Petnadjanka...
É uma cidade bem quieta.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3019</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>13000001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>以前に来た時は、もっと
にぎやかな街だったような……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Da última vez que estive aqui,
parecia bem mais animada.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>13000002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>嫌な予感がする……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tenho um mau pressentimento...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3107</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>13000003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり……&lt;Blue&gt;王の盾&lt;White&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Será que é por causa do
&lt;Blue&gt;Escudo Real&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3143</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>13000004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おそらくな……気をつけて進もう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Provavelmente... Fiquem alertas.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3413</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>27000018</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あれ、ここは……？
ペトナジャンカ……だよな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hã...? Eu tô em Petnadjanka?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3513</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>27000019</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Veigue&gt;？　&lt;Hilda&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Veigue&gt;? &lt;Hilda&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3557</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2700001a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>一体、おれは……
どうしちまったんだ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Como é que eu... Que diabos tá
acontecendo...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3603</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2700001b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おーい、みんなー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, cadê todo mundo!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3759</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2700001c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;、何やってるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Tytree&gt;, o que é que você
está fazendo?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3827</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2700001d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>姉貴……？
なんでこんなところに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mana...? O que você tá
fazendo aqui?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3866</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2700001e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんでって……
おかしな事を言うのね？
巡回の時間だから呼びに
来たんじゃないの。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O que eu estou fazendo aqui? Que
pergunta boba. Está na hora da
ronda, então vim te buscar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3895</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>2700001f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>巡回？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ronda?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4005</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>27000020</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ま、待ってくれよ、姉貴。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, espera, mana...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰もいないのに、すすり泣く声が
聞こえるなんて……
そんなこと、私には信じられません。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ouvir alguém chorando sem haver
ninguém ali... Não consigo
acreditar em algo assim...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4417</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、あんなに怖がっているのが
ウソだとは思えない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas, pelo medo que ele tinha,
acho que não estava mentindo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4463</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく工場に行って、
みんなに話を聞いてみようぜ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bom, vamos até a fábrica
perguntar aos outros operários
sobre isso.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
